=Baldwin Calls Snap Election

The Prime Minister has called a snap election hoping to win yet another term in office, resting on his laurels he promises no major action. Just a continuation of the agenda he pushed this term. 

The King has dissolved parliament, and new elections are scheduled for later this month.

- @good: Nice

